			description: ["Bind 'Open Skill Tree' in Controls, open it, spend a point.", "", "Points come from levelling the tree, and the tree levels from", "kills: an enemy is worth its dropped XP plus max health / 20.", "Anti-farming caps this at 15 kills per chunk per five minutes."]
