			title: "Take A Path"
			description: ["The outer ring holds eight Path nodes. Taking one unlocks that", "specialisation as its own tab with its own points and levels.", "", "All eight exclude each other. This is the single biggest", "decision in the pack and only a Malevolent Manuscript undoes it.", "The base tree also hard-caps at 42 spent points."]
